# Z9X (LineageOS 21 TV) keylayout for Vendor_000d_Product_3839:
#   XGIMI BLE music controller
# Generated by make_keylayouts.py from the stock /vendor/usr/keylayout/Vendor_000d_Product_3839.kl.
# XGIMI-only labels are remapped ("XGIMI:" comments) or dropped; see global_keys.xml for the
# keys routed to org.z9x.projector / org.z9x.tvinput.

